1
00:00:00,170 --> 00:00:02,610
(Leonard:)I wonder what
changed her mind.

2
00:00:02,610 --> 00:00:05,240
(Sheldon:)Perhaps your talk
of my sexual prowess

3
00:00:05,240 --> 00:00:07,880
(Sheldon:)renewed her faith in love.

4
00:00:07,880 --> 00:00:10,650
(Amy:)As good an explanation as any.

5
00:00:12,020 --> 00:00:14,220
(Leonard:)That's great...

6
00:00:18,140 --> 00:00:19,200
(Penny:)Oh, hey, Amy.

7
00:00:19,200 --> 00:00:20,200
(Penny:)Bernadette just texted me.

8
00:00:20,210 --> 00:00:21,670
(Penny:)Howard proposed?

9
00:00:21,670 --> 00:00:23,270
(Amy:)Yes, not important.
Just stopped by

10
00:00:23,270 --> 00:00:24,890
(Amy:)to let you know I'm
getting orthotics.

11
00:00:24,890 --> 00:00:26,210
(Amy:)Also, I'm carrying
Sheldon's baby.

12
00:00:26,210 --> 00:00:27,380
(Amy:)Mum's the word.

13
00:00:33,720 --> 00:00:36,790
You're pregnant?!

14
00:00:38,060 --> 00:00:40,900
(Amy:)Wow. Is there anything
on there about orthotics?

